{"availability":"available","full":"LynnHaDo/Checkbox-Detection","name":"Checkbox-Detection","description":"Checkbox Detection Model for Scanned Documents","category":"Education","language":"Jupyter Notebook","stars":97,"forks":6,"created":"2023-07-05T13:52:03Z","updated":"2025-03-06T15:59:00Z","license":"AGPL-3.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/linhdo/checkbox-detector","topics":["computer-vision","copy-paste","deep-learning","document-understanding","object-detection","python","yolov8"],"demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/linhdo/checkbox-detector","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T00:30:19.998Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T00:30:19.998Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T00:30:19.998Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T00:30:19.998Z","stars":97,"forks":6}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["In this project, I provided 2 models (classification and detection models) trained on the existing YOLOv8 weights. They are uploaded in my Hugging Face Space of the project. If you feel the need to use or fine-tune the models in any parts of your work, please cite this repository. Thank you, and don't forget to give this repo a 🌟!","The biggest challenge when I approach this problem is the lack of public datasets that contain documents with checkbox annotations. There are only either images of checkboxes alone, or images of scanned documents. As a result, the solution comes down to generating a sufficiently large annotated dataset of document with checkboxes.","Although the idea of using the Copy-Paste technique in augmenting data is simple, how to make that augmented dataset works well with the existing YOLO architecture is the most difficult part, which takes a lot of trial and error. Throughout this process, I experimented with different ways to paste the checkboxes onto the documents, which include pasting boxes contiguously in horizontal and vertical directions, pasting distractors, adding \"background\" images, pasting while also avoiding text blocks (using the Document Layout Analysis model I created), etc. I ended with over 10,000 images for…"],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/LynnHaDo/Checkbox-Detection/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"2effc53194515641fbdbd3b5e919179c575aa88ffc4fd81a4e9126af4f5f442d","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T00:30:20.250Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T00:30:20.250Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"In this project, I provided 2 models (classification and detection models) trained on the existing YOLOv8 weights. They are uploaded in my Hugging Face Space of the project. If you feel the need to use or fine-tune the models in any parts of your work, please cite this repository. Thank you, and don't forget to give this repo a 🌟!","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/LynnHaDo/Checkbox-Detection/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"2effc53194515641fbdbd3b5e919179c575aa88ffc4fd81a4e9126af4f5f442d","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/LynnHaDo/Checkbox-Detection/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T00:30:20.251Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2025-03-06T15:59:00Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/LynnHaDo/Checkbox-Detection/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T00:30:20.251Z","hash":"2effc53194515641fbdbd3b5e919179c575aa88ffc4fd81a4e9126af4f5f442d","originalBytes":8827,"storedBytes":8827,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["dataset","install","model","pip","document","images","understanding","which","xfund","back","documents","models","multilingual","project","title","top","ultralytics","yolov8","association","author","booktitle","checkbox","checkboxes","data","existing","family-names","form","given-names","gradio","human-annotated","layoutxlm","orcid","pasting","pre-trained","rich","url","using","visually","works","year","yolo","about","address","albumentations","analysis","available","benchmark","boxes","built","c